      </p>
      <p begin="00:13.800" end="00:18.000" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">
        <span begin="00:13.800" end="00:14.400">Scrub</span>
        <span begin="00:14.400" end="00:14.800">the</span>
        <span begin="00:14.800" end="00:15.550">timeline</span>
